==German==

[[Image:Foto-Exkursion Berlin 2008 05.JPG|thumb|Die deutsche Fahne vor dem Reichstag in Berlin.<br>''The German flag in front of the [[w:Reichstag|Reichstag]] in [[w:Berlin|Berlin]]''.]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|vano}} / {{term|van}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|fano}}, from the Germanic root ''*fanō'' (''cloth, flag''), from Proto-Indo-European ''*pān'' (''fabric'').

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|['faːnə]|lang=de}}, plural: {{IPA|['faːnən]|lang=de}}
* Fah·ne, plural: Fah·nen

===Noun===
{{de-noun|g=f|pl=Fahnen|dim=Fähnchen}}

# the [[flag]] (of a [[nation]], [[organisation]], etc); a [[banner]]
# an [[idea]], an [[ideal]]
# the [[notice]]able [[smell]] of [[alcohol]] on one's [[breath]]

====Synonyms====
* (''flag, banner''): [[Flagge]], [[Banner]], [[Standarte]]
* (''ideal''): [[Idee]], [[Prinzip]], [[Motto]]
* (''smell of alcohol''): [[Alkoholfahne]]

